ad6871186a","maturity":"draft","page_type":"entity","path":"pages/entities/ratnesh-181998-ai-engineer-efad6871186a.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"ratnesh-181998/ai-engineer","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:44:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2167f4ed908e44abb956d02c804324b4"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0167c5774ead920605dd749e6930617d2cdf81582b1fedafe663db9b3beb360a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README describes an 'AI 5 Layer Cake' stack: energy, chips, infrastructure, models, and applications."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2d3911bd4f6f9518e460763e3956f22ca485a6b65124e1e63c1069adbd1f7e4b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README states MCP gives agents access to tools while A2A lets agents connect and collaborate with other agents, and that A2A agents can be modeled as MCP resources via their AgentCard."},{"claim_ids":["clm_75a45fb7f269bbe5131a5e3ff4ea823719c2304feaa98a254b4ea8a8acf03c58"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repository is a curated learning resource for AI engineering, covering agentic AI, generative AI, LLMs, and RAG topics as stated in its README heading."},{"claim_ids":["clm_89a2532b2a17e86d683f2d475f80c905b507a735bae934c67cf77c6b007089a4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README explains the A2A (Agent2Agent) protocol: agents collaborate by exchanging context, task updates, instructions, and data without sharing internal memory or tools."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8b93c66fb20c3478ca90b33182fa018afbbe329fd9fa3d58984071a030cad258"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"It surveys 12 major RAG architectures, noting RAG has evolved from naive vector retrieval to agentic, multi-hop, graph-driven, and federated systems."},{"claim_ids":["clm_975844edb21f48ded2e3beb8ef77712be7c166de402ffd6633c56a0cab6bfd40"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Per the README, A2A-supporting remote agents must publish a JSON Agent Card describing capabilities and authentication, which clients use to discover and select agents."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b68a157b36f841dd242586d42bc6dfb43b2c424825cdb5e8c77baa018ba8737f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README presents an 'AI Periodic Table' taxonomy organizing AI concepts into rows: primitives (prompts, embeddings, LLMs), compositions (function calling, vector DBs, RAG, guardrails), deployment, and emerging elements."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b9d981bc505c1c7d65bb1b563fb1d6ecc286e9d84ef81364a8a4f9cf5eae26a7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"It describes composite 'reactions' such as a RAG chatbot combining prompts, embeddings, vector DB, retrieval, LLM, and guardrails, and an agentic system as agent plus function calling plus frameworks looping until a goal is achieved."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ce26b4fba75a33f753c1d16f819dd92f3b10a96f7291e7ffa1a4bfa654bad56a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README cites roughly twenty academic papers (mostly arXiv links) under a section on LLM hallucination."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d9bdcb76466253798fea323db7fdc13c4f0c4fbccc0fdc13d1f4f14f78598e97"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The snapshot appears to contain no executable code or product runtime; the evidence consists of README documentation, images, and linked PDFs, so it functions as a reference collection rather than a runnable agent."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e0e7c44ccbf5f405c17b81b52351245db6eeb600de25cb2d0d60e737267ca457"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repository links to external learning assets: a PDF on retrieval types in RAG, PDFs on reinforcement learning, LangChain components, LLM training, and small language models for agents, plus many YouTube talks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fe8ffad80f10e3493fc717497fc0e7304d9081cb7e73657efe9834afbe307876"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README lists 15 LLM fine-tuning techniques to learn, including LoRA, QLoRA, prefix and adapter tuning, RLHF, RLAIF, DPO, and GRPO."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0167c5774ead920605dd749e6930617d2cdf81582b1fedafe663db9b3beb360a","clm_2d3911bd4f6f9518e460763e3956f22ca485a6b65124e1e63c1069adbd1f7e4b","clm_75a45fb7f269bbe5131a5e3ff4ea823719c2304feaa98a254b4ea8a8acf03c58","clm_89a2532b2a17e86d683f2d475f80c905b507a735bae934c67cf77c6b007089a4","clm_8b93c66fb20c3478ca90b33182fa018afbbe329fd9fa3d58984071a030cad258","clm_975844edb21f48ded2e3beb8ef77712be7c166de402ffd6633c56a0cab6bfd40","cl